  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 261.42,
      "e": 264.5,
      "text": "at St. Thomas, your first status of 2-1."
    },
    {
      "s": 264.5,
      "e": 276.16,
      "text": "Got the 2-1 standing by for the hover checks on 2-2."
    },
    {
      "s": 276.16,
      "e": 279.37,
      "text": "I have you loud and clear over."
    },
    {
      "s": 279.37,
      "e": 296.7,
      "text": "They're all SCT right?"
    },
    {
      "s": 296.7,
      "e": 299.27,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "s": 299.27,
      "e": 301.87,
      "text": "They've got about a 30 mile range on their radio,"
    },
    {
      "s": 301.87,
      "e": 303.95,
      "text": "so just keep that in the same air."
    },
    {
      "s": 303.95,
      "e": 304.75,
      "text": "OK."
    },
    {
      "s": 304.75,
      "e": 305.83,
      "text": "They're good to come."
    },
    {
      "s": 305.83,
      "e": 306.95,
      "text": "They've probably talked about it."
    },
    {
      "s": 306.95,
      "e": 308.55,
      "text": "I'll let the King aircraft know."
    },
    {
      "s": 308.55,
      "e": 310.27,
      "text": "They're in St. Martin right now, so I got to say."
    },
    {
      "s": 310.27,
      "e": 312.11,
      "text": "Once you have any new stuff, them coming over,"
    },
    {
      "s": 312.11,
      "e": 314.87,
      "text": "and the ETA, 20 minutes, whatever, let me know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 314.87,
      "e": 317.47,
      "text": "so I can call the guy and customs is ready over there."
    },
    {
      "s": 317.47,
      "e": 318.67,
      "text": "Take your numbers, sir."
    },
    {
      "s": 318.67,
      "e": 320.19,
      "text": "Hey, we've got it."
    },
    {
      "s": 320.19,
      "e": 321.67,
      "text": "Stand by, we'll check."
    },
    {
      "s": 321.67,
      "e": 322.67,
      "text": "One to day."
    },
    {
      "s": 322.67,
